{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/check(against:)"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Compares the plan with ","type":"text"},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the files of a plan exported before, and reports every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Checking a plan","anchor":"Checking-a-plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"check"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"against"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"committed"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TrackingPlan","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"File","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TrackingPlanCheck","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","preciseIdentifier":"s:13Tr